{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "game": "gi",
  "id": "wind-courage-and-wings-book",
  "name": "Wind, Courage, and Wings",
  "sourceUrl": "https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Wind,_Courage,_and_Wings_(Book)",
  "scrapedAt": "2026-07-26T09:10:18.803Z",
  "volumes": [
    {
      "id": "1",
      "volumeKey": "text",
      "label": "Text",
      "document": {
        "version": 1,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "When the first wisp of wind brushed across the land"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-510e09f79fcb64c9"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Birds that yearned for the sky had wings"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-a4a1893145acfd21"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "But no way to fly"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-ca73b22d01aa5d5e"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "They asked the Anemo God:"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-0938ab2fac3b671f"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "\"How can we reach the heavens?\""
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-1d6cd3895d723a8c"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "To which the Anemo God replied:"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-727b72c169468398"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "\"You have yet to find that which is most important\""
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-e52ed31637b78db7"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "As the God spoke, the wind thrust the seeds of a dandelion"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-21628f297b2a7a08"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "High into the sky"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-b0037bc93dea9b40"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The birds thrust out their wings"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-ad9be282c926feaa"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "But the breeze was all too mild"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-18568bd1ab79852a"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Leaving them to stumble across the earth"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-4fe41cd76dd7cfd9"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "So they went to the gorge"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-f702289bda817f62"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Where the wind showed off its wild and incomparable strength"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-76029fcb6c4c8506"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "They threw themselves off the cliff"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-c586a9552e1dd2e0"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "And flapped their wings amongst the howling winds"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-eb6c8705066b8e0d"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Until they were able to fly freely in the sky"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-9a8a8485dcd58435"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "To the Anemo God they went, to gleefully say:"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-17e3fa552d85b77e"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "\"We understand now! All we needed was a stronger wind to fly\""
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-cb75468d4ba85bb4"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "In reply the Anemo God said:"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-862ddef826e7c6ec"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "\"What you lacked was not wind, but courage\""
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-676c3dd7591b9493"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "\"It is courage that has allowed you to become the first flying birds of this world\""
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-1a318e8d50497049"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
